From 9adae85c6380c6317f296349ded38126d8ecc964 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sera Brocious <sera.brocious@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 14:07:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Propagate ordinary inventory save errors and accept
 successful empty deletes

Check cursor preclear, container clearing, parent replacement and recursive child writes. Preserve partial-write and cursor iterator behavior; do not introduce transactions or change shared-bank storage. Accurate leaf results do not provide rollback safety for callers that mutate and publish before saving.

Add a Linux/GCC standalone actual-source SQL-seam regression with connection denial. Eight of twelve cases fail before the fix; all twelve pass after, including the CMake target. This prerequisite remains undeployed pending operation-level ownership and transaction handling.
